              "fontSize": 38,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "yCaJj",
              "name": "item1",
              "fill": "#F5F0E8",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "1. ESP32-WROVER DevKit ×1：自带 Wi‑Fi + 蓝牙；优先带 PSRAM；不要 C3/S3。",
              "lineHeight": 1.15,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 25,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "dbghO",
              "name": "item2",
              "fill": "#BBF7D0",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "2. MAX98357A I2S 功放 ×2：确认有 L/R 或 SD/MODE 声道选择。",
              "lineHeight": 1.15,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 25,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "5RiQg",
              "name": "item3",
              "fill": "#DDD6FE",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "3. 4Ω 3W/5W 喇叭 ×2：拆机件也行，注意左右固定牢。",
              "lineHeight": 1.15,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 25,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "tjNDa",
              "name": "item4",
              "fill": "#67E8F9",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "4. SSD1306 OLED I2C ×1：128×64，4 针 VCC/GND/SDA/SCL。",
              "lineHeight": 1.15,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 25,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "K9Gpn",
              "name": "item5",
              "fill": "#FDBA74",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "5. EC11 旋转编码器 ×1：带按压开关，最好买带旋钮帽。",
              "lineHeight": 1.15,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 25,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "bPwiw",
              "name": "item6",
              "fill": "#FCA5A5",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "6. 5V 2A 供电：USB 充电头/充电宝/USB-C 小模块都可以。",
              "lineHeight": 1.15,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 25,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "V8vNo",
              "name": "item7",
              "fill": "#FDE68A",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "7. 470µF 电解电容 ×2 + 洞洞板/排针/杜邦线/热熔胶/扎带。",
              "lineHeight": 1.15,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 25,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "wzfo5",
              "name": "item8",
              "fill": "#D6D3D1",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "8. 外壳：旧路由器壳、铁盒、木板边角料；铁盒必须给天线留窗口。",
              "lineHeight": 1.15,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 25,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "vmcnG",
              "name": "item9",
              "fill": "#67E8F9",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Wi‑Fi 不另买模块：ESP32 已内置。金属外壳会屏蔽信号，天线区域必须露出或开塑料窗。",
              "lineHeight": 1.15,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 24,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
