              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "1. 只接 OLED：烧测试程序，看到开机字样再继续。",
              "lineHeight": 1.15,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 27,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "xGyhD",
              "name": "step2",
              "fill": "#FDBA74",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "2. 接旋钮：串口打印 A/B/SW，确认旋转方向和按压。",
              "lineHeight": 1.15,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 27,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "t3W3H",
              "name": "step3",
              "fill": "#BBF7D0",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "3. 接一块 MAX98357A + 一个喇叭：I2S 播放测试音。",
              "lineHeight": 1.15,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 27,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "zUmwQ",
              "name": "step4",
              "fill": "#DDD6FE",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "4. 接第二块功放：设置 L/R，测试左右声道，反了就换声道焊盘。",
              "lineHeight": 1.15,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 27,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "JpGcE",
              "name": "step5",
              "fill": "#FDE68A",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "5. 加 470µF 电容：靠近功放 VIN/GND，减少爆音和掉压。",
              "lineHeight": 1.15,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 27,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "YG3MB",
              "name": "step6",
              "fill": "#F5F0E8",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "6. 跑网络电台，再跑蓝牙 A2DP；两个单独稳定后再合并。",
              "lineHeight": 1.15,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 27,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "DdWpv",
              "name": "step7",
              "fill": "#D6D3D1",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "7. 最后进外壳：先螺丝/扎带定位，确认散热，再热熔胶补强。",
              "lineHeight": 1.15,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 27,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
